  slide "Partition again across worker shards" {
    eyebrow: "Execute · 12 of 20"
    title: "Partition again across worker shards"
    lede: "Inside a cell the same ownership rule applies across thread-per-core workers. Nested ownership stays deterministic and disjoint, so the second partition level never overlaps the first."
