  slide "Retain rows for exact artifacts" {
    eyebrow: "Reduce · 16 of 20"
    title: "Retain rows for exact artifacts"
    lede: "The retain path preserves per-record data and merges it in a deterministic topology order. Retain costs O(records) but keeps raw record artifacts available, carried home as CellMessage::Partition."
