  slide "Exact-fold into ColumnStore" {
    eyebrow: "Reduce · 17 of 20"
    title: "Exact-fold into ColumnStore"
    lede: "Each completed record folds into an exact mergeable store and the row is dropped. Exact-fold retains exact record-derived aggregates without retaining rows, trading raw artifacts for bounded memory."
    narration: "Each completed record folds into an exact mergeable store and the row is dropped. Exact-fold keeps exact aggregates without retaining rows."
